#: ../../source/hardware_and_software_configuration/configuring/managing_esd/managing-esd.rst:2
msgid "Managing Electrostatic Discharge Effects"
msgstr "静電気放電（ESD）の影響への対処"

#: ../../source/hardware_and_software_configuration/configuring/managing_esd/managing-esd.rst:5
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "はじめに"

#: ../../source/hardware_and_software_configuration/configuring/managing_esd/managing-esd.rst:7
msgid ""
"Electrostatic discharge (ESD) events have the potential to disrupt the "
"normal operation of a competition robot. This section examines causes of "
"ESD events and discusses ways to mitigate the risk that an ESD event will"
" disable or damage a robot's control system."
msgstr ""
"静電気放電（ESD）は競技ロボットの正常な動作を妨げる可能性があります。"
"このセクションでは ESD の原因を検討し、ESD によってロボットのコントロールシステムが"
"無効化・損傷されるリスクを軽減する方法について説明します。"

#: ../../source/hardware_and_software_configuration/configuring/managing_esd/managing-esd.rst:12
msgid ""
"Note that this section only provides a brief overview of the physical "
"phenomenon that causes ESD disruptions. You can use the following link to"
" view an in-depth white paper, written by Mr. Eric Chin (a *FIRST* "
"alumnus and a 2018 summer engineering intern), which examines and "
"quantifies the efficacy of various ESD mitigation techniques:"
msgstr ""
"このセクションでは ESD の乱れを引き起こす物理現象の概要のみを説明します。"
"様々な ESD 緩和技術の有効性を検討・定量化した詳細な白書（*FIRST* 卒業生で 2018 年夏期エンジニアリングインターンの"
"Eric Chin 氏執筆）は次のリンクからご覧いただけます。"

#: ../../source/hardware_and_software_configuration/configuring/managing_esd/managing-esd.rst:18
msgid ""
":download:`ESD Mitigation Techniques For FTC (PDF 1.7MB) <files/analysis-"
"esd-mitigation-echin.pdf>`"
msgstr ""
":download:`FTC 向け ESD 緩和技術（PDF 1.7MB）<files/analysis-esd-mitigation-echin.pdf>`"

